{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04241","headline":"陪润州薛司空丹徒桂明府游招隐寺 · 骆宾王","name":"陪润州薛司空丹徒桂明府游招隐寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共寻招隐寺，初识戴顒家。\n还依旧泉壑，应改昔云霞。\n绿竹寒天笋，红蕉腊月花。\n金绳倘留客，爲系日光斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}